<title>POLAND: ELEKTROBUDOWA NOV NET UP TO PLN 0.5 MLN.</title>
<headline>ELEKTROBUDOWA NOV NET UP TO PLN 0.5 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results November</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.45 vs   0.36</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.55 vs   0.44</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.70 vs   0.78</p>
<p> Sales		   16.93 vs  17.28</p>
<p>JANUARY-NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	    13.05 vs   8.25</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	23.34 vs  13.32</p>
<p> Operating profit    25.24 vs  16.04</p>
<p> Sales		  200.48 vs 151.67</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish construction firm is</p>
<p>Elektrobudowa SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
